   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The accent mark is on the first syllable: «KO-mo-dos». The d is soft, never «th».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "vieja",
   "significado": "old (feminine)",
